coder › Changed secrets handling on branch `work/redact-secrets` (2 commits).

What changed:
- Added `src/redact.ts` exporting `redact(value)`: recursively walks plain objects/arrays, replaces the value of any key whose lowercased name contains `password|passwd|secret|token|apikey|api_key|api-key|authorization` with `'[redacted]'`, and rewrites `Bearer <token>` in any string to `Bearer [redacted]` (`/Bearer [^\s]+/g`). Returns new objects/arrays, never mutates input.
- `src/logger.ts`: `log()` now spreads `redact(fields)` instead of `fields`.
- Tests: new `src/redact.test.ts` (key substrings/case, nesting, Bearer, passthrough, non-mutation); extended `src/logger.test.ts` with top-level and nested redaction cases.

Checks — `bun test`:
```
bun test v1.3.14 (0d9b296a)
